msgid "Cycles render samples for the whole static export -- the background, the character light atlas, the shadows and the layer sprites all use the same value so they stay consistent. Higher is cleaner but slower; lower for tests"
msgstr "整个静态导出使用的 Cycles 渲染采样数 —— 背景、角色光照图集、阴影和图层精灵都使用同一数值以保持一致。数值越高越干净但越慢；测试时可用较低值"

